{"id":"f89b3dbb5152ec03","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-model-companion.md","title":"Model Companion","display":"df-model-companion — Model Companion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-model-companion","aliases":["17-df-model-companion"],"display":"df-model-companion — Model Companion","depends_on":["[[17-df-universal-consequences]]","[[17-df-model-completeness]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive-label","source_section":"3.5","source_result":"Unnumbered model-companion definition before Examples 3.5.12","source_pages_print":[197],"source_pages_djvu":[213],"source_verification":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; parameter orientation made explicit; local extension to inconsistent theories disclosed","verification_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-model-companion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-model-companion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model-companion — Model Companion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1bb6e1781f34c54a\" href=\"?note=1bb6e1781f34c54a\" title=\"17-df-universal-consequences\">17-df-universal-consequences</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive-label"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.5"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Unnumbered model-companion definition before Examples 3.5.12"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>197</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>213</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition compared in supplied DjVu OCR; parameter orientation made explicit; local extension to inconsistent theories disclosed"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1bb6e1781f34c54a\" href=\"?note=1bb6e1781f34c54a\" title=\"17-df-universal-consequences\">17-df-universal-consequences</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a>。\n以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\\)</span>；第一参数为候选伴随理论，第二参数为原理论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T^*,T)\\land\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T^*,T)\\land\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷 p.197、DjVu 213，在 Examples 3.5.12 前给出此定义。定义要求共享全称后承与候选理论的模型完全性；不要求原理论完全，也不要求两个公理集合有字面包含关系。</p>\n<p>一致性约定：原书印刷 p.186（DjVu 202）的模型完全性定义限于一致理论；本条沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"59d623a1692279f1\" href=\"?note=59d623a1692279f1\" title=\"17-df-model-completeness\">17-df-model-completeness</a> 的本地谓词，保留不一致时的空真延拓。故来源对应在一致理论上按原书理解；不一致边界由模型类为空另行核对，不把该延拓冒称原书定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-universal-consequences","status":"resolved","id":"1bb6e1781f34c54a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-universal-consequences]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-universal-consequences","status":"resolved","id":"1bb6e1781f34c54a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。\n$\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]，$\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-completeness]]。\n以下定义 $\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)$；第一参数为候选伴随理论，第二参数为原理论。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。\n$\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L$ 见 [[17-df-universal-consequences]]，$\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-completeness]]。\n以下定义 $\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)$；第一参数为候选伴随理论，第二参数为原理论。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一致性约定：原书印刷 p.186（DjVu 202）的模型完全性定义限于一致理论；本条沿用 [[17-df-model-completeness]] 的本地谓词，保留不一致时的空真延拓。故来源对应在一致理论上按原书理解；不一致边界由模型类为空另行核对，不把该延拓冒称原书定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\n\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Cotheory}_L(T^*,T)\\land\\operatorname{ModelComplete}_L(T^*).","display":true}],"bytes":1739,"backlinks":[{"id":"31695c838dded93c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]，$L(\\mathfrak A)$ 及 $\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A)$ 见 [[17-df-diagram]]。\n对每个 $\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$，把 $T^*$ 的句子按同一字符串包含进 $L(\\mathfrak A)$；$\\operatorname{Complete}(T^*\\cup\\operatorname{Diag}(\\mathfrak A))$ 是 [[17-df-theory-properties]] 的完全性谓词在语言 $L(\\mathfrak A)$ 的实例，包含可满足性。\n以下定义 $\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L(T^*,T)$，参数次序与模型伴随相同。"},{"id":"e06453cde5ebbf0f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L=L_{<}$，$T_{\\mathrm{LO}}$ 与 $T_{\\mathrm{DLO}}$ 分别见 [[17-df-linear-order-theory]]、[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]，均采用严格序。\n$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n量词消去见 [[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]；与模型完备化的联系见 [[17-thm-model-completion-qe]]。"},{"id":"256a095d7318cb9c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*,T^{**}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。\n$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]，$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。\n证明使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 的延拓及 [[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]] 的初等链定理。"},{"id":"d868412e4c7fb403","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 固定，$T,T^*\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$、$\\operatorname{ModelCompletion}_L$ 分别见 [[17-df-model-companion]]、[[17-df-model-completion]]。\n$\\operatorname{Amalgamation}_L(T)$ 使用 [[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]] 的普通嵌入。证明中图示和完全性分别取 [[17-df-diagram]]、[[17-df-theory-properties]] 的扩张语言实例；使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 及 [[17-thm-compactness]] 的紧致性。完全理论的两个任意模型的初等联合嵌入在下文直接由紧致性论证。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-model-companion]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-df-elementary-extension]]\n[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[17-df-embedding]]\n[[17-df-embedding-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-existentially-closed]]\n[[17-df-filter]]\n[[17-df-filters]]\n[[17-df-first-order-language]]\n[[17-df-formula]]\n[[17-df-formula-consequence]]\n[[17-df-fraisse-class]]\n[[17-df-free-variable]]\n[[17-df-generated-filter]]\n[[17-df-generated-substructure]]\n[[17-df-homogeneous-model]]\n[[17-df